Interesting idea.  I'm not sure about the spell level stuff as you would
have to be level fifteen before you could cast a sixth level spell, and
that's a bit too high.  How about just twice the character level?  Once
you get beyond a certain point, you start gaining levels rather quickly
(especially when you hit the Valley of the Dead...Wraiths are good eats).

An alternate idea would be to keep energy points, but give players
higher maximum energy.  The catch?  You have to destroy gems to gain
back energy.  Make the more valuable gems worth more energy points. 
You'd have to make sure it's balanced, but it might work.


